<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>校园论坛</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: #fafaf8; color: #1a1a1a;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* 导航 */
    .nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      height: 56px; padding: 0 40px;
      background: rgba(250,250,248,.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }
    .nav-brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a;
      text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }
    .nav-brand svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; color: #f97316; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 13px; color: #706f6c; text-decoration: none;
      padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 500;
      transition: color .2s, background .2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #1a1a1a; background: rgba(0,0,0,.04); }
    .nav-user {
      font-size: 12px; color: #94928f; margin-left: 12px;
      max-width: 80px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* 主体 */
    .main {
      flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 80px 24px; text-align: center;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block; padding: 5px 16px; border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(249,115,22,.06); color: #e05b10;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .04em;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .main h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
      font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.04em;
      line-height: 1.1; color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .main h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #dc2626);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    .main .sub {
      font-size: 18px; color: #94928f; line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 480px; margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    /* 统计 */
    .stats {
      display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 56px; margin-bottom: 64px;
    }
    .stat { text-align: center; }
    .stat-num { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 13px; color: #94928f; margin-top: 6px; }

    /* 两个大入口卡片 */
    .gates {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px;
      max-width: 640px; width: 100%;
    }
    .gate {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
      padding: 44px 32px 36px; border-radius: 20px;
      text-decoration: none; color: #1a1a1a;
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eeede8;
      transition: all .3s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
    }
    .gate:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      border-color: #d8d5ce;
    }
    .gate-icon {
      width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 18px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 30px;
    }
    .gate-icon.qa { background: #fff5f0; }
    .gate-icon.blog { background: #f0f2ff; }
    .gate h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; }
    .gate p {
      font-size: 13px; color: #94928f; line-height: 1.5;
      max-width: 200px;
    }
    .gate-arrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #706f6c;
      padding: 7px 18px; border-radius: 8px;
      background: #f5f4f1; transition: all .2s;
    }
    .gate:hover .gate-arrow { background: #1a1a1a; color: #fff; }

    .foot {
      text-align: center; padding: 32px;
      font-size: 12px; color: #c4c0b8;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .gates { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .main { padding: 48px 20px; }
      .main h1 { font-size: 34px; }
      .main .sub { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
      .nav { padding: 0 20px; }
      .stats { gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
      .stat-num { font-size: 26px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
        <rect x="1" y="8" width="26" height="17" rx="4" fill="currentColor" opacity=".12"/>
        <path d="M7 8V5a4 4 0 014-4h0a4 4 0 014 4v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M1 12h26" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/>
        <circle cx="14" cy="18" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"/>
      </svg>
      校园论坛
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <% if (currentUser) { %>
        <a href="/qa">问答</a>
        <a href="/blog">博客</a>
        <a href="/messages">消息</a>
        <a href="/announcements">公告</a>
        <a href="/me">我的</a>
        <% if (currentUser === 'admin') { %><a href="/admin" style="color:#dc2626">管理</a><% } %>
        <span class="nav-user"><%= currentUser %></span>
        <a href="/logout" style="color:#ef4444;margin-left:8px">退出</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/login">登录</a>
        <a href="/register">注册</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="tag">校园实名社区</div>
    <h1>有问题，<em>大家一起答</em></h1>
    <p class="sub">学习、选课、美食……任何困惑都能找到答案。经验分享、技术笔记，每条知识都值得沉淀。</p>

    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num"><%= qaCount %></div>
        <div class="stat-label">个问题</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num"><%= blogCount %></div>
        <div class="stat-label">篇文章</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num"><%= userCount %></div>
        <div class="stat-label">位同学</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gates">
      <a href="/qa" class="gate">
        <div class="gate-icon qa">💬</div>
        <h2>问答社区</h2>
        <p>互帮互助，解决校园里的各种难题</p>
        <span class="gate-arrow">进入问答 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog" class="gate">
        <div class="gate-icon blog">📝</div>
        <h2>知识博客</h2>
        <p>分享经验与见解，沉淀你的知识</p>
        <span class="gate-arrow">浏览博客 →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">校园论坛 · 你的问题，大家来帮</div>

</body>
</html>
